# Device evidence from demo/prove-offline-push.mjs (TASK-225). Ignored for TWO reasons and
# the second is the load-bearing one:
#   - it is regenerable: screenshots, uiautomator dumps and JSON off a real Android
#     instance, all reproduced by re-running the script
#   - IT HOLDS CREDENTIALS. The run writes admin.email / admin.pw / admin.cookie so its
#     phases can log back in, and a live admin session cookie in a git history is a leak
#     that deleting the file does not undo. Ignored here BEFORE any of it was committed,
#     which is the lesson docs/media above was already paid for once.
.field-recordings/

# every screenshot is regenerable; none of them are worth a public blob
docs/media/
